   "text": "Long paths are shortened: e.g. .trialCategory, .trialDuration and .endPoint sit under\nauthorizedPartI.trialDetails.trialInformation, and .clinicalTrialIdentifiers under\nauthorizedPartI.trialDetails. Full paths of what we read: src/trialwatch/sources/ctis.py.",
